# markdown-syntax AST->HTML conformance suite v1: syntax decisions
source: block_markers
decision: A block marker opens its block only before a space or a tab: `#` to `######`, a bullet or ordered list marker, and the `>` that opens a block quote, which a bare `>` or `>text` still continues; an item whose marker line holds nothing else is empty and takes no line after it (decision 0019).
count: 47

